+    :func:`once_per_args` considers all parameters, including keyword-only
+    arguments, ``*args`` and ``**kwargs``. Omitting a default value and passing it
+    explicitly count as the same call, as do equivalent positional and keyword
+    forms. Keyword argument order does not matter. Unhashable argument values
+    are compared by equality.
